  "summary": "A single-user family bookshelf lending tracker. Each book has Title, Author, Category (Novel/Cookbook/Reference) and starts Available. Books can be added, edited, and deleted. Lend out collects the borrower's name; Mark returned clears it. The collection can be filtered to Lent out, a live Lent out count is shown, and data persists across refreshes. Required input is validated and malformed saved data is recovered without crashing.",
